OL,3,GNEWSA'People were screaming in pain'   
OL,4,Aduring Co-op Live evacuation           
OL,6,FConcertgoers have described feeling    
OL,7,F"unsafe" and seeing "distressing"      
OL,8,Fscenes and people "coughing up blood", 
OL,9,Fwith some claiming the venue's security
OL,10,Fwas lax.                               
